{
  "name": "BareLiteralJudgedByForm",
  "comment": "PLang is an intent language: a literal is typed by its form + the variable's intent, no `as`\nneeded. \"2026-01-01\" births a date, \"PT30S\" a duration, \"42\" a number; a written date\nnormalizes to ISO; a version-like label under %version% stays text. `as` is only a force.",
